"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"lm_sensors\"/> , <xref linkend=\"nettle\"/>, <xref "
"linkend=\"valgrind\"/>, <ulink "
"url=\"https://archive.mesa3d.org/demos/\">mesa-demos</ulink> (provides more "
"than 300 extra demos to test <application>Mesa</application>; this includes "
"the same programs added by the patch above), <ulink "
"url=\"https://omxil.sourceforge.net/\">Bellagio OpenMAX Integration "
"Layer</ulink> (for mobile platforms), and <ulink "
"url=\"https://github.com/tizonia/tizonia-openmax-il/wiki/Tizonia-OpenMAX-"
"IL/\"> libtizonia</ulink>,"
msgstr ""
"<xref linkend=\"libgcrypt\"/>, <xref linkend=\"libunwind\"/>, <xref linkend="
"\"lm_sensors\"/>, <xref linkend=\"nettle\"/>, <xref linkend=\"valgrind\"/>, "
"<ulink url=\"https://archive.mesa3d.org/demos/\">mesa-demos</ulink> (fornece "
"mais que 300 extra demos para testar <application>Mesa</application>; isso "
"inclui os mesmos programas adicionados pelo remendo acima), <ulink url="
"\"https://omxil.sourceforge.net/\">Bellagio OpenMAX Integration Layer</"
"ulink> (para plataformas móveis) e <ulink url=\"https://github.com/tizonia/"
"tizonia-openmax-il/wiki/Tizonia-OpenMAX-IL/\">libtizonia</ulink>,"

#. type: Attribute 'xreflabel' of: <sect1><sect2>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:156
#, xml-text
msgid "Mesa Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração de Núcleo do Mesa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:157
#, xml-text
msgid "Kernel Configuration"
msgstr "Configuração do Núcleo"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:160
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Enable the following options in the kernel configuration and recompile the "
"kernel if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Habilite as seguintes opções na configuração do núcleo e recompile o núcleo "
"se necessário:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:169
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The corresponding Mesa Gallium3D driver name is provided as the comment for "
"the configuration entries.  If you don't know the name of the Mesa Gallium3D"
" driver for your GPU, see <xref linkend=\"mesa-gallium-drivers\"/> below."
msgstr ""
"O correspondente nome do controlador Gallium3D do Mesa é fornecido como "
"comentário para as entradas de configuração. Se você não sabe o nome do "
"controlador Gallium3D do Mesa para tua GPU, veja <xref linkend=\"mesa-"
"gallium-drivers\"/> abaixo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:176
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_RADEON</option>, <option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option>, "
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_NOUVEAU</option>, and <option>CONFIG_DRM_I915</option> "
"may require firmware.  See <xref linkend='postlfs-firmware'/> for details."
msgstr ""
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_RADEON</option>, <option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option>, "
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_NOUVEAU</option> e <option>CONFIG_DRM_I915</option> "
"possivelmente exijam firmware. Veja-se <xref linkend='postlfs-firmware'/> "
"para detalhes."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:184
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Selecting <option>CONFIG_DRM_RADEON</option> or "
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option> as <quote><literal>y</literal></quote> is"
" not recommended. If it is, any required firmware must be built as a part of"
" the kernel image or the initramfs for the driver to function correctly."
msgstr ""
"Selecionar <option>CONFIG_DRM_RADEON</option> ou "
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option> como <quote><literal>y</literal></quote> "
"não é recomendado. Se for, qualquer firmware exigido precisa ser construído "
"como parte da imagem do núcleo ou do initramfs para o controlador funcionar "
"corretamente."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:192
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"The sub-entries under <option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option> are used to ensure "
"the AMDGPU kernel driver supports all GPUs using the "
"<literal>radeonsi</literal> driver.  They are not needed if you won't need "
"<option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option> itself. They may be unneeded for some GPU"
" models."
msgstr ""
"As subentradas sob <option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option> são usadas para "
"garantir que o controlador de núcleo AMDGPU suporte todas as GPUs usando o "
"controlador <literal>radeonsi</literal>. Elas não são necessárias se você "
"não precisasse da própria <option>CONFIG_DRM_AMDGPU</option>. Elas "
"possivelmente sejam desnecessárias para alguns modelos de GPU."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"For <literal>swrast</literal>, <option>CONFIG_DRM_VGEM</option> is not "
"strictly needed but recommended as an optimization."
msgstr ""
"Para <literal>swrast</literal>, <option>CONFIG_DRM_VGEM</option> não é "
"estritamente necessária, mas recomendada como uma otimização."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid "mesa"
msgstr "mesa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Mesa"
msgstr "Instalação do Mesa"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have downloaded the xdemos patch (needed if testing the Xorg "
"installation per BLFS instructions), apply it by running the following "
"command:"
msgstr ""
"Se você baixou o remendo &quot;xdemos&quot; (necessário se testar a "
"instalação do &quot;Xorg&quot; de acordo com as instruções do BLFS), [então]"
" aplique-o executando o seguinte comando:"

#. <screen>
#. <userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../mesa-&mesa-
#. version;-add_xdemos-1.patch</userinput></screen>
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:218
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../mesa-add_xdemos-2.patch</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../mesa-add_xdemos-2.patch</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:284
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Mesa</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o <application>Mesa</application> executando os seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:288
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX   \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"      -Dplatforms=x11,wayland \\\n"
"      -Dgallium-drivers=auto  \\\n"
"      -Dvulkan-drivers=auto   \\\n"
"      -Dvalgrind=disabled     \\\n"
"      -Dlibunwind=disabled    \\\n"
"      ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup                   \\\n"
"      --prefix=$XORG_PREFIX   \\\n"
"      --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"      -Dplatforms=x11,wayland \\\n"
"      -Dgallium-drivers=auto  \\\n"
"      -Dvulkan-drivers=auto   \\\n"
"      -Dvalgrind=disabled     \\\n"
"      -Dlibunwind=disabled    \\\n"
"      ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:304
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results, issue: <command>meson configure -Dbuild-tests=true "
"&amp;&amp; ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados, emita: <command>meson configure -Dbuild-"
"tests=true &amp;&amp; ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:314
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:317
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:320
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If desired, install the optional documentation by running the following "
"commands as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se desejado, [então] instale a documentação opcional executando os seguintes"
" comandos como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:326
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cp -rv ../docs -T /usr/share/doc/mesa-&mesa-version;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cp -rv ../docs -T /usr/share/doc/mesa-&mesa-version;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:331
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:334
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--buildtype=release</parameter>: This switch ensures a fully-"
"optimized build, and disables debug assertions which will severely slow down"
" the libraries in certain use-cases. Without this switch, build sizes can "
"span into the 2GB range."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--buildtype=release</parameter>: Essa chave garante uma "
"construção totalmente otimizada e desabilita asserções de depuração que "
"desacelerarão severamente as bibliotecas em certos casos de uso. Sem essa "
"chave, os tamanhos de construção podem atingir a faixa de 2 GB."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:341
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<anchor id='mesa-gallium-drivers' xreflabel='Mesa Gallium3D Drivers'/> "
"<parameter>-Dgallium-drivers=auto</parameter>: This parameter controls which"
" Gallium3D drivers should be built.  <literal>auto</literal> selects all "
"Gallium3D drivers available for x86: <literal>r300</literal> (for ATI Radeon"
" 9000 or Radeon X series), <literal>r600</literal> (for AMD/ATI Radeon HD "
"2000-6000 series), <literal>radeonsi</literal> (for AMD Radeon HD 7000 or "
"newer AMD GPU models), <literal>nouveau</literal> (for Supported NVIDIA "
"GPUs, they are listed as all <quote>3D features</quote> either "
"<quote>DONE</quote> or <quote>N/A</quote> in <ulink "
"url='https://nouveau.freedesktop.org/FeatureMatrix.html'>the Nouveau status "
"page</ulink>), <literal>virgl</literal> (for QEMU virtual GPU with "
"<application>virglrender</application> support; note that BLFS <xref "
"linkend='qemu'/> is not built with <application>virglrender</application>), "
"<literal>svga</literal> (for VMWare virtual GPU), <literal>swrast</literal> "
"(using CPU for 3D rasterisation; note that it's much slower than using a "
"modern 3D-capable GPU, so it should be only used if the GPU is not supported"
" by other drivers), <literal>iris</literal> (for Intel GPUs shipped with "
"Broadwell or newer CPUs), <literal>crocus</literal> (for Intel GMA 3000, "
"X3000 series, 4000 series, or X4000 series GPUs shipped with chipsets, or "
"Intel HD GPUs shipped with pre-Broadwell CPUs), <literal>i915</literal> (for"
" Intel GMA 900, 950, 3100, or 3150 GPUs shipped with chipsets or Atom D/N "
"4xx/5xx CPUs).  You may replace <literal>auto</literal> with a comma-"
"separated list to build only a subset of these drivers if you precisely know"
" which drivers you need, for example <option>-Dgallium-"
"drivers=radeonsi,iris,swrast</option>."
msgstr ""
"<anchor id='mesa-gallium-drivers' xreflabel='Mesa Gallium3D Drivers'/> "
"<parameter>-Dgallium-drivers=auto</parameter>: Esse parâmetro controla quais"
" controladores Gallium3D deveriam ser construídos. <literal>auto</literal> "
"seleciona todos os controladores Gallium3D disponíveis para x86: "
"<literal>r300</literal> (para Radeon 9000 ou série Radeon X da ATI), "
"<literal>r600</literal> (para série Radeon HD 2000-6000 da AMD/ATI), "
"<literal>radeonsi</literal> (para Radeon HD 7000 da AMD ou modelos de GPU "
"mais recentes da AMD), <literal>nouveau</literal> (para GPUs Suportadas da "
"NVIDIA, elas estão listadas como todos os <quote>recursos de 3D</quote> "
"tanto <quote>DONE</quote> quanto <quote>N/A</quote> na <ulink "
"url='https://nouveau.freedesktop.org/FeatureMatrix.html'>página de situação "
"da Nouveau</ulink>), <literal>virgl</literal> (para GPU virtual do QEMU com "
"suporte <application>virglrender</application>; observe que o BLFS <xref "
"linkend='qemu'/> não é construído com o "
"<application>virglrender</application>), <literal>svga</literal> (para GPU "
"virtual do VMWare), <literal>swrast</literal> (usando CPU para rasterização "
"de 3D; observe que isso é muito mais lento que usar uma GPU moderna com "
"recursos de 3D, de forma que deveria ser usado somente se a GPU não for "
"suportada por outros controladores), <literal>iris</literal> (para GPUs "
"Intel fornecidas com Broadwell ou CPUs mais recentes), "
"<literal>crocus</literal> (para GPUs GMA 3000, série X3000, série 4000 ou "
"série X4000 da Intel fornecidas com chipsets ou GPUs Intel HD fornecidas com"
" CPUs pré-Broadwell), <literal>i915</literal> (para GPUs GMA 900, 950, 3100 "
"ou 3150 da Intel fornecidas com chipsets ou CPUs Atom D/N 4xx/5xx). Você "
"pode substituir <literal>auto</literal> por uma lista separada por vírgulas,"
" para construir somente um subconjunto desses controladores, se souber "
"precisamente quais controladores precisa, por exemplo <option>-Dgallium-"
"drivers=radeonsi,iris,swrast</option>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:380
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dplatforms=...</parameter>: This parameter controls which "
"windowing systems will be supported. Available linux platforms are x11 and "
"wayland."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dplatforms=...</parameter>: Esse parâmetro controla quais "
"sistemas de janelas serão suportados. As plataformas Linux disponíveis são "
"x11 e wayland."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:386
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dvulkan-drivers=auto</parameter>: This switch enables support "
"for the Vulkan graphics API. It automatically builds all graphics drivers "
"that are available for Vulkan. If you wish to build specific drivers, valid "
"options include 'amd', 'intel', 'intel_hasvk', and 'swrast'. If you do not "
"want Vulkan support, change 'auto' to \"\"."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dvulkan-drivers=auto</parameter>: Essa chave habilita suporte "
"para a API gráfica Vulkan. Ele constrói automaticamente todos os "
"controladores gráficos que estão disponíveis para Vulkan. Se você desejar "
"construir controladores específicos, as opções válidas incluem 'amd', "
"'intel', 'intel_hasvk' e 'swrast'. Se você não quiser suporte Vulkan, mude "
"'auto' para \"\"."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:394
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dvalgrind=disabled</parameter>: This parameter disables the "
"usage of Valgrind during the build process. Remove this parameter if you "
"have Valgrind installed, and wish to check for memory leaks."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dvalgrind=disabled</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita o uso "
"do &quot;Valgrind&quot; durante o processo de construção. Remova esse "
"parâmetro se você tiver o &quot;Valgrind&quot; instalado e desejar verificar"
" vazamentos de memória."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:400
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dlibunwind=disabled</parameter>: This parameter disables the "
"usage of libunwind."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dlibunwind=disabled</parameter>: Esse parâmetro desabilita o uso"
" da &quot;libunwind&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:405
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>meson configure -Dbuild-tests=true</command>: This command will "
"reconfigure the build to set <option>-Dbuild-tests=true</option>, but keep "
"the other options specified in the <command>meson setup</command> command "
"unchanged.  It allows <command>ninja test</command> to build and run unit "
"tests."
msgstr ""
"<command>meson configure -Dbuild-tests=true</command>: Esse comando "
"reconfigurará a construção para configurar &quot;<option>-Dbuild-"
"tests=true</option>&quot;, mas manterá as outras opções especificadas no "
"comando &quot;<command>meson setup</command>&quot; sem mudanças. Ele permite"
" que o &quot;<command>ninja test</command>&quot; construa e execute testes "
"unitários."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/installing/mesa.xml:413
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Degl-native-platform=\"...\"</option>: This parameter controls "
"which Embedded Graphics Library support will be built. Available linux "
"options are auto (default), x11, wayland, surfaceless, and drm."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Degl-native-platform=\"...\"</option>: Esse parâmetro controla qual"
" suporte da Biblioteca de Gráficos Incorporados será construído. As opções "
"de Linux disponíveis são &quot;auto&quot; (padrão), &quot;x11&quot;, "
"&quot;wayland&quot;, &quot;surfaceless&quot; e &quot;drm&quot;."

